{"4898890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FIRE. HOLD. REPEAT.", "steam_appid": 4898890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5001830, 5088540], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every click you make — moves the game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire. Hold. Repeat. — a desktop companion loot shooter that lives on your screen while you do your thing. Click in your browser, type in a document, play another game or do something else — your soldier shoots, throws grenades, destroys enemies and picks up new gear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A shooter built around your actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soldier stands in the center. Enemies advance from both sides. He picks the nearest target within weapon range on his own — but won't shoot without your clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets fly in real time. 18 enemy types with different behaviors push toward you, creating pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every click is in-game currency</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 click = 1 shell casing. Always. Shell casings are spent on gear upgrades — only you decide what to upgrade and when. And while you're busy doing your thing — shell casings and progress keep stacking up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spotted the drone — got loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killed enemies drop gear. The drone delivers it straight to your inventory. Open it, check it, equip the better piece — sell the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/b725d1405cb5f80f716e8fc9b6a9b781.webp?t=1788315856\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/b725d1405cb5f80f716e8fc9b6a9b781.poster.avif?t=1788315856\" class=\"bb_img\" width=75 height=75 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/0fb6f2db7746cb4a1cbcec8bb85b9130.webp?t=1788315856\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/0fb6f2db7746cb4a1cbcec8bb85b9130.poster.avif?t=1788315856\" class=\"bb_img\" width=125 height=75 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/34f6a598c51d1f8b0e707fa3f347341d.webp?t=1788315856\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/34f6a598c51d1f8b0e707fa3f347341d.poster.avif?t=1788315856\" class=\"bb_img\" width=125 height=75 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/853e14a30259b9ccb49b78b4c4fee0a8.webp?t=1788315856\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/853e14a30259b9ccb49b78b4c4fee0a8.poster.avif?t=1788315856\" class=\"bb_img\" width=125 height=75 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/1a0fe3b2433505ebad2022237d452162.webp?t=1788315856\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/1a0fe3b2433505ebad2022237d452162.poster.avif?t=1788315856\" class=\"bb_img\" width=125 height=75 /></picture></span>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every drop can change your build. Or not. But you still want to know what you got.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gear is more than bigger numbers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols, SMGs, assault rifles, shotguns and snipers have different ranges, fire rates, accuracy, magazine sizes and fire modes. That's different behavior in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>6 rarity tiers: Field · Army · Combat · Secret · Hidden · Ultra</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weapon of Army rarity or higher can carry one of six synergies — Fire, Poison, Explosive, Electric, Pierce, Debuff. Ammo activates the synergy. A grenade with the same synergy makes it even stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage — several waves of enemies with increasing difficulty and a boss at the end. 20 biomes with their own environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/8e2117759342494e12cbadb1216164f9.webp?t=1788315856\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/extras/8e2117759342494e12cbadb1216164f9.poster.avif?t=1788315856\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1024 height=64 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion window — doesn't get in the way of anything you're doing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every click anywhere = a combat step and a shell casing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ unique weapons: pistols, SMGs, rifles, shotguns, snipers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 rarity tiers: Field → Army → Combat → Secret → Hidden → Ultra</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets, grenades and damage numbers in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot delivered by drone straight to your inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, armor, attachments, ammo, grenades, medkits, pouches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammo and grenade synergy — 6 combat synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades, selling, levels, stat bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 biomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i>macOS version in future updates!</i></u></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every click you make — moves the game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire. Hold. Repeat. — a desktop companion loot shooter that lives on your screen while you do your thing. Click in your browser, type in a document, play another game or do something else — your soldier shoots, throws grenades, destroys enemies and picks up new gear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A shooter built around your actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soldier stands in the center. Enemies advance from both sides. He picks the nearest target within weapon range on his own — but won't shoot without your clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets fly in real time. 18 enemy types with different behaviors push toward you, creating pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every click is in-game currency</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 click = 1 shell casing. Always. Shell casings are spent on gear upgrades — only you decide what to upgrade and when. And while you're busy doing your thing — shell casings and progress keep stacking up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Spotted the drone — got loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killed enemies drop gear. The drone delivers it straight to your inventory. Open it, check it, equip the better piece — sell the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragra