otguns, snipers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 rarity tiers: Field → Army → Combat → Secret → Hidden → Ultra</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets, grenades and damage numbers in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot delivered by drone straight to your inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, armor, attachments, ammo, grenades, medkits, pouches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammo and grenade synergy — 6 combat synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades, selling, levels, stat bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 biomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i>macOS version in future updates!</i></u></p>", "short_description": "The only desktop companion shooter on Steam. Your soldier holds the line right on your desktop. Every click and every keystroke fires a shot – fend off endless enemy waves, loot weapons and upgrade your gear while you go about your day.", "supported_languages": "English, Ukrainian, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/a11f10bd1897cf24e771fce452d41c0f6ca92bee/header.jpg?t=1788315856", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/c6adec60abf0f73ea9322ea4d46522fe78346806/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788315856", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898890/c6adec60abf0f73ea9322ea4d46522fe78346806/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788315856", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.0 GHz / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4